#: ../../../customisation/right-to-left.md:1
msgid "Changing text and layout to right-to-left"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../customisation/right-to-left.md:3
msgid ""
"Furo makes it fairly straightforward to change the text direction across the "
"entire documentation set, by indicating the desired text direction to the "
"browser and adapting the layout accordingly."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../customisation/right-to-left.md:5
msgid ""
"This is done by setting `is_rtl` in [`html_theme_options`][sphinx-"
"html_theme_options] in `conf.py`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../customisation/right-to-left.md:7
msgid ""
"html_theme_options = {\n"
"    \"is_rtl\": True,\n"
"}\n"
msgstr ""
